# Admin web environment.
#
# Development: leave VITE_API_URL unset; Vite proxies /api and /socket.io to
# localhost:4000.
#
# Production (Vercel/Cloudflare): set BOTH values to your Render service.
# VITE_API_URL must include /api/v1.
# VITE_API_URL=https://<your-render-service>.onrender.com/api/v1
# VITE_SOCKET_URL=https://<your-render-service>.onrender.com
#
# If you proxy /api through the static host (same-origin cookies), set
# VITE_API_URL=/api/v1 and still point VITE_SOCKET_URL at Render.
